    "Cat Form now gives a Hero the hidden SPELL_AURA_MOD_IGNORE_SHAPESHIFT auras 9726361-9726364 (one per spell family). Rogue mask 9726363 covers Blind; no mask covers a mana spell, so Regrowth is still refused with SPELL_FAILED_NOT_SHAPESHIFT (68).",
    "The auras leave with the form, and a stock Druid in Cat Form gets none of them."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
